{"id": "65152", "title": "念念不忘", "author": "东奔西顾", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 43, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/65/65152.htm", "intro": "那一年，她与他擦肩而过\r\n 那一年，她成为他的女朋友\r\n 那一年，她与他天各一方\r\n 那一年，她与他相濡以沫\r\n 那一年，她与他相忘于江湖\r\n 那一年，她与他执子之手，与子偕老......\r\n 你见，或者不见我，我就在那里，不悲不喜\r\n 你念，或者不念我，情就在那里，不来不去\r\n 你爱，或者不爱我，爱就在那里，不增不减\r\n 你跟，或者不跟我，我的手就在你手里，不舍不弃\r\n 来我怀里，或者，让我住进你的心里，黯然 相爱 寂静 欢喜\r\n \r\n 喜欢就戳戳这里!\r\n 收藏此文章\r\n 新坑！\r\n \r\n 谢谢倚秋桐-大秋帮我做的专栏图片，灰常感谢！大家可以戳一戳哟！", "base": "files/article/html/65/65152", "chapters": [{"title": "狭路相逢", "file": "9697119.html", "available": false}, {"title": "辗转", "file": "9697120.html", "available": false}, {"title": "相见欢", "file": "9697121.html", "available": false}, {"title": "丰华", "file": "9697123.html", "available": false}, {"title": "孩子", "file": "9697126.html", "available": false}, {"title": "似是故人来", "file": "9697130.html", "available": false}, {"title": "情不知所起，一往而深1", "file": "9697131.html", "available": false}, {"title": "情不知所起，一往而深2", "file": "9697132.html", "available": false}, {"title": "情不知所起，一往而深3", "file": "9697133.html", "available": false}, {"title": "情不知所起，一往而深4", "file": "9697134.html", "available": false}, {"title": "毒药", "file": "9697135.html", "available": false}, {"title": "妖孽初现", "file": "9697136.html", "available": false}, {"title": "招标", "file": "9697139.html", "available": false}, {"title": "醉酒", "file": "9697143.html", "available": false}, {"title": "吻", "file": "9697145.html", "available": false}, {"title": "对弈", "file": "9697147.html", "available": false}, {"title": "严父慈母", "file": "9697149.html", "available": false}, {"title": "六少聚齐", "file": "9697151.html", "available": false}, {"title": "京城贵公子", "file": "9697152.html", "available": false}, {"title": "晚宴", "file": "9697153.html", "available": false}, {"title": "胃疼", "file": "9697154.html", "available": false}, {"title": "金燕西出现", "file": "9697155.html", "available": false}, {"title": "番外之顾墨涵", "file": "9697156.html", "availab